COMPILATION OF: E49I5

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49I5

   1 a 0000 E49I5:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P4] `rec.s2 <= rec.na' -- swapped weak, written short-
   4 a 0006      first: lowered loads na first, `06 03 / 3E 02', JC da.  Fourth
   5 a 0006      witness for the weak skip byte at unequal extents. */
   6 c 0006   dcl
   7 c 0006     1 rec,
   8 c 0006       2 na char(3),
   9 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  10 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  11 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  12 c 0006   if rec.s2 <= rec.na then k = 1;
  13 c 001E   put list('K=', k);
  14 c 0040   stop;
  15 a 0043 end E49I5;

CODE SIZE = 0043
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
